| bare | easy | 1610099127, 1866182087, 726129344, 872519758 | 0 / 0 | every call returned HTTP 403 key-limit error |
| hinted | easy | 1500512047, 1962934556, 881264122, 1912685597 | 0 / 0 | every call returned HTTP 403 key-limit error |
| placebo | easy | 2143620254, 835939291, 143474477, 836775871 | 0 / 0 | every call returned HTTP 403 key-limit error |

The hinted-minus-placebo diagnostic is therefore undefined, not zero. Once access is
