+        "CISE_{1,2} for n log_2(p) < m < p/(2n^4), conditional on worst-case "
+        "SIVP_(p n^6); the shipping preset n=3,m=64,p=20743 is in that regime, "
+        "its balanced inverse-planted public distribution has leftover-hash "
+        "distance at most 0.0012 from uniform, and the measured construction-aware "
+        "LLL sweep completes all reductions but finds 0/8 witnesses (final timing "
