+| easy | 1,605,078,455 | xAI Grok 4.6 | HTTP 403 key limit; harness aborted |
+
+This is infrastructure evidence only, not a hardness result. Re-run the bare arm after restoring OpenRouter quota; do not submit the current transcript as a hardened verdict.
+
+## G9 arms
+
+| Arm | Solved / valid attempts | Status |
+|---|---:|---|
+| bare | 0 / 0 | blocked before inference |
+| structural hint | 0 / 0 | not run |
+| placebo hint | 0 / 0 | not run |
+
+Hinted minus placebo is unavailable (stored as `0.0` only because both denominators are zero); no conclusion about the invariant can be drawn. The answer is 43 characters (about 11 tokens), and the intended route is bounded at 168 exact operations, with 70 observed in the eight-seed compact-route audit.
+
+## Use
+
+```python
