+
+    rho = {inst['rho']},    rho_inverse = {inst['rho_inv']},
+    t = {inst['t']},
+    v = [{vector}].
+
+For each one-based index i=1,...,m, define beta_i and the vector part of c_i by
+
+    beta_i = rho                  if i is odd,
+             rho_inverse          if i is even;
